Package: clustmrev
Title: Reviewing Clustering Methods for All-Cause Mortality
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Menezes de Araujo", , "pedromenezes98@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides implementations of four clustering methods reviewed in
    the literature for grouping countries by all-cause mortality patterns:
    Hellinger distance with complete linkage, ILC k-means, PCA-based fuzzy
    c-means, and functional k-means on life expectancy at birth. Analysis and
    visualisation functions are included for each method, along with a sample
    dataset from the Human Mortality Database.
